{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10115180","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10115180","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:4:1011518001:0":{"text":"...황혼의 나무, 땅거미 숲의 상징, 우리 마음속 성스러운 곳.","source_cn":"……流荧树，薄暮丛林的象征，我们心中的神圣所在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2556305C7791C98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1011518002:1":{"text":"당신의 그늘 아래에서 태어나지 않았다면, 내 인생이 달라졌을까 하는 생각도 해봤어요.","source_cn":"我曾想过，假如不是在你的树荫下降生，我的人生是否会有所不同？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DF58C63C1DD0C31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1011518003:0":{"text":"지금도 당신과의 연결이 느껴지지 않아요... 신성한 계시는 물론 어떤 징조조차 못 받았죠.","source_cn":"即使到了现在，我依旧感觉不到和你的链接……既没有神启，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67E50963F100CFEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1011518004:0":{"text":"하지만 그래도 전 제 사명을 이해했습니다.","source_cn":"不过，即便如此，我也已经了然自己的使命。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1ADBB16D40A855D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1011518005:0":{"text":"황혼의 나무의 아들이든 아니든 저는 숲의 일원이에요.","source_cn":"无论是不是流荧树之子，我都是丛林的一员。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE4CB78CEC9899B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1011518006:0":{"text":"그리고 제 검으로 당신을 지키겠습니다.","source_cn":"我要用手中的剑，守护你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A607B470FBA3668","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:11:1011539:0":{"text":"숲이 위기에 봉착했다. 황혼의 나무의 아들인 에이론은 한참 동안 황혼의 나무를 말없이 바라보았다.","source_cn":"危机当前，作为流荧树之子的埃隆，久久地望着流荧树。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6102659E5CF17922","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:埃隆":{"text":"에이론","source":"埃隆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":12,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":1}}